    "identifier": "heavenly-foot-of-pain",
    "description": "<p>You put an enormous amount of chakra into the heel of your foot as you make a single downward kick. Make a Taijutsu attack against a target in range. On a hit target takes 7d10 Bludgeoning damage.</p>\n<p>Finisher: All surrounding creatures, objects and structures (excluding you), within 30 feet of the target must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save they take half damage. If you deal damage to a Barrier this way, the barrier takes the full damage dealt and treats the damage as if it was vulnerable.     At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
